    "organization": "The Rock School for Dance Education",
    "program": "RockReach",
    "mission": {
      "content": "The program provides Philadelphia’s student youth with high-quality arts instruction and interaction, emphasizing all aspects of socio-emotional learning as part of their individual in-school classroom curriculum and school community mission."
    },
    "targetPopulation": {
      "content": "RockReach engages K-12 participants from low income schools in under resourced communities, including Title 1, public, and charter schools with few or no arts offerings in Philadelphia county. Most RockReach school sites serve predominantly students of color. They include ESL learners, special needs students with Individualized Education Programs, including students who are non-verbal, have Autism Spectrum Disorder, mobility impairments, and are blind or low-sight."
    },
