          "name": "PROBLEM STATEMENT",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1. RockReach was created in 2000 in response to the lack of performing arts education offerings specifically dance and music in Philadelphia public school’s classroom curriculum. RockReach includes dance and bucket drumming, student performances, and opportunities to attend live dance performance in Philadelphia.",
              "sourcePage": 2,
              "sourceHeader": "PROBLEM STATEMENT",
              "sourceSection": "PROBLEM STATEMENT",
              "mappingConfidence": "unmapped"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "CONTEXT / RATIONALE",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "RockReach enriches these students’ education through professional teaching artists who understand their needs and encourage them to explore dance and music in new ways.",
              "sourcePage": 2,
